      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 5.24,
          "end": 5.72,
          "en": "All right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.72,
          "end": 8.66,
          "en": "In this section we are going to talk about searching algorithm.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.66,
          "end": 12.47,
          "en": "As the name implies, searching algorithm is mentioned to search for something.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.47,
          "end": 16.91,
          "en": "So when we say search some of you might think of something like Google right away.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.94,
          "end": 22.16,
          "en": "Not the algorithm behind Google search is very complex, probably the most complex one because the algorithm",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 22.16,
          "end": 25.04,
          "en": "behind Google works on based on the many factors.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 25.04,
          "end": 30.59,
          "en": "Which means for me, when searching for something might give different results, for others, it might",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 30.59,
          "end": 31.79,
          "en": "give different results.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 31.82,
          "end": 36.38,
          "en": "It depends on many things like browsing history, or the things that you clicked or the things that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 36.38,
          "end": 36.89,
          "en": "you have done.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 36.89,
          "end": 39.08,
          "en": "So we are not going to look at Google search.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 39.08,
          "end": 44.42,
          "en": "We will just learn commonly used ones, which is helpful for our interviews and applications.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 44.42,
          "end": 48.2,
          "en": "So in this course we are going to look at linear search and binary search.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 48.23,
          "end": 50.3,
          "en": "Now the first one is linear search.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 50.3,
          "end": 53.09,
          "en": "So linear search is the simplest searching technique.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 53.09,
          "end": 56,
          "en": "In this technique the items are searched one by one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 56,
          "end": 59.81,
          "en": "This procedure is also applicable for unsorted data set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 59.84,
          "end": 62.77,
          "en": "Linear search is also known as sequential search.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.77,
          "end": 65.35,
          "en": "So let's say we have an array like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.35,
          "end": 68.11,
          "en": "And we want to search for the value of four.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.11,
          "end": 70.87,
          "en": "And it can be easily seen that four is located in this array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.9,
          "end": 72.64,
          "en": "Now the linear search works like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 72.67,
          "end": 77.53,
          "en": "It starts from the first element and checks that if this is the element that we are looking for or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 77.56,
          "end": 79.6,
          "en": "We see that in the first element we have five.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 79.6,
          "end": 81.67,
          "en": "So this is not the element that we are looking for.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.7,
          "end": 83.56,
          "en": "It's going to continue to the next element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.56,
          "end": 85.39,
          "en": "So in the next element we have three.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.39,
          "end": 87.37,
          "en": "So this is not the element that we are looking for.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87.4,
          "end": 89.05,
          "en": "Then it continues to the next element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.05,
          "end": 90.67,
          "en": "Is this the element that we are looking for.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 90.7,
          "end": 91.69,
          "en": "We see that it is not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 91.72,
          "end": 97.15,
          "en": "It will continue to the next element and check that if this is the element that we are looking for or",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 97.15,
          "end": 97.33,
          "en": "not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 97.36,
          "end": 98.28999999999999,
          "en": "We see that it is not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 98.32,
          "end": 99.75999999999999,
          "en": "It continues to the next element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 99.75999999999999,
          "end": 105.13,
