          "en": "we see that it is not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 151.02,
          "end": 152.97,
          "en": "Then it continues to the next iteration.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 152.97,
